    },
    "A BHA that helps keep pores clear and reduce excess oil." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BHA yang membantu menjaga pori tetap bersih dan mengurangi minyak berlebih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A common cause of irritation, especially for sensitive skin." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyebab iritasi yang umum, terutama untuk kulit sensitif."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few spots are active. Small changes add up — keep tracking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ada beberapa titik yang aktif. Perubahan kecil itu berarti — terus pantau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A freeze covers one missed day automatically. Earn one every %lld days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pembeku menutup satu hari yang terlewat secara otomatis. Dapatkan satu setiap %lld hari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A harsh cleanser that strips natural oils." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pembersih keras yang mengikis minyak alami kulit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A humectant that helps skin hold water." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Humektan yang membantu kulit menahan air."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A light oil that moisturises without heaviness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Minyak ringan yang melembapkan tanpa terasa berat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little more active than usual. One scan isn't a trend — check again in a few days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sedikit lebih aktif dari biasanya. Satu pindaian belum jadi tren — cek lagi beberapa hari lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lot is active right now. If it's painful or persistent, a dermatologist can help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Banyak yang aktif saat ini. Jika terasa sakit atau tidak kunjung hilang, dokter kulit bisa membantu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new streak starts with one step." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rangkaian baru dimulai dari satu langkah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new streak starts with your next scan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rangkaian baru dimulai dari pindaian berikutnya."
