    "Photo analysis happens on your device; your data never leaves it during analysis. Saved scans and products are stored in your personal iCloud account via CloudKit, which Skinalyze cannot access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Analisis foto dilakukan di perangkatmu; datamu tidak pernah keluar selama analisis. Pindaian dan produk yang disimpan berada di akun iCloud pribadimu melalui CloudKit, yang tidak bisa diakses Skinalyze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photos are analysed on this iPhone. Saved scans stay on your device and your own iCloud — never on our servers." : {
      "localizations" : {
